1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,980
Kuch din pehle maine ek free UPI Gateway banaya tha...

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,460
Ab dekho, log mujhe kya bhej rahe hain!

3
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,400
"It‘s working perfectly."

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,920
"Install successful?" — "Yes!"

5
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:13,000
Kisi ne VPS par install kar liya,

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,940
kisi ne apni website par live chala liya

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:19,260
aur kisi ne kaha — "main theek aisa hi workflow dhoondh raha tha."

8
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,340
Agar aapne pichhli reel miss kar di —

9
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:24,620
UPI Gateway ek open-source payment gateway hai.

10
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,640
Customer QR scan karta hai,

11
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:29,980
paisa seedhe aapke apne UPI account mein aata hai.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,680
Payment apne-aap verify ho jaata hai.

13
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,100
Gateway apna koi commission nahi leta.

14
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:37,260
Aur ab sabse bada update —

15
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,580
Shopify support!

16
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,720
Yaani Shopify store ho, apni website ho ya app

17
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,720
har jagah laga sakte ho.

18
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,260
Setup ke do raaste hain.

19
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,520
GitHub se download karo

20
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:49,180
aur installation wizard se khud setup karo.

21
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,220
Na SSH, na coding.

22
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:54,140
Ya phir apne business ke liye humse setup karwa lo.

23
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,720
Bas live jaane se pehle

24
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:58,360
ek chhota test payment zaroor karna.

25
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,640
Comment karo "UPI"

26
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:02,200
Repo ka link aur setup ki details

27
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:03,900
seedhe aapke DM mein!
